    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i'm not really worried about the side effects. i've taken high doses before and i'm fine. i just want to know the upper limit so i can actually see results. like, if i wanted to go all out for a two week blitz, what kind of milligram dosage would be the most effective for the metabolism boost? i need a specific number to aim for.",
