      "content": "There is no scientifically determined \"upper limit\" or specific milligram dosage that guarantees maximum metabolism boost because individual responses vary significantly, and pushing for extreme doses without supervision is dangerously imprudent. Attempting to aggressively stack high caffeine with potent green tea extract for a \"blitz\" carries substantial health risks, including acidosis, insomnia, and organ stress, which could derail your trip preparation. Instead of chasing a specific number, focusing on a moderate combined dose, consistent daily intake, and aggressive sleep/recovery practices is the only responsible way to safely see lasting results. Relying on extreme stimulants usually yields diminishing returns while increasing fatigue and jitteriness, which matters less for you right now than your long-term health.",
