      "content": "look i appreciate the concern but i'm not asking for medical advice for a permanent lifestyle change, i'm just asking for nutritional info on what the high end of the spectrum looks like for these supplements. if a nutritionist or an athlete was trying to maximize thermogenesis, what kind of mg numbers are we talking about for caffeine and EGCG? just give me the high range so i know what to look for on the supplement labels.",
